    "post_text": [
      "Last week we hosted 2 of the biggest After Parties in the City  for the RnB Tour Concert !❤️‍🔥💫 S/o to @iamdjfresh 🎤 for pulling up both nights && being on crowd control ! 🔥 From the stadium to Denim he kept the city on lock ! Special thank you to every promoter, share, tag , repost && ticket sale ! We strive to provide the best service each && every time we welcome you to Denim on 7th ! If you’re in another city stay on the lookout we are still on the move ! 😎 \n#birminghamnightlife  #rnbtour #chrisbrown #usher #afterparty 🎉🥂 \n🎥: @thee_danielprescott"
